# Always publish updates

After finishing any feature, fix, or requested change in this project:

1. Bump `update.json` version (patch +1, e.g. 1.0.20 -> 1.0.21).
2. Commit the relevant files with a concise message.
3. Push to `origin` `main` so other PCs can click Update.

Do this every time. Do not wait to be asked "did you send it for update?"
If the user says to forget/revert a change, do not publish that change.
